@startuml SEQ_06_MENGELOLA_KEGIATAN
!theme plain
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam TitleFontSize 14
title Sequence Diagram — SEQ-06: Mengelola Kegiatan

actor       "Admin / Asisten"    as User
boundary    "KegiatanPage"       as Page
control     "KegiatanController" as Ctrl
entity      "Kegiatan"           as ModelKegiatan

== Lihat Daftar Kegiatan ==

User -> Page          : Buka halaman /kegiatan
Page --> User : response / redirect
Page -> Ctrl          : GET /kegiatan
Ctrl --> Page : response / redirect
Ctrl -> ModelKegiatan : Query kegiatan berdasarkan lab
ModelKegiatan --> Ctrl : Data kegiatan
Ctrl --> Page         : Render halaman daftar kegiatan
Page --> User         : Tampil daftar kegiatan beserta status approval

== Tambah Kegiatan Baru ==

User -> Page          : Isi form & submit
Page --> User : response / redirect
Page -> Ctrl          : POST /kegiatan\n{nama, proker_id, tipe, lokasi, tanggal}
Ctrl --> Page : response / redirect
Ctrl  -> ModelKegiatan : create({...data, status_approval: 'diajukan'})
ModelKegiatan --> Ctrl : Hasil proses
Ctrl  --> Page         : Redirect dengan notifikasi sukses
Page  --> User         : Tampil notifikasi sukses

== Edit Kegiatan ==

User -> Page          : Klik Edit, ubah data & submit
Page --> User : response / redirect
Page -> Ctrl          : PUT /kegiatan/{id}
Ctrl --> Page : response / redirect
Ctrl -> ModelKegiatan : Query kegiatan
ModelKegiatan --> Ctrl : Data kegiatan
alt Sudah disetujui
  Ctrl --> Page : Pesan error kegiatan yang sudah disetujui tidak dapat diedit
  Page --> User : Tampil pesan error
else Belum / ditolak
  Ctrl  -> ModelKegiatan : update({...data})
  ModelKegiatan --> Ctrl : Hasil proses
  Ctrl  --> Page         : Redirect dengan notifikasi sukses
  Page  --> User         : Tampil notifikasi sukses
end

== Hapus Kegiatan ==

User -> Page          : Klik Hapus & konfirmasi
Page --> User : response / redirect
Page -> Ctrl          : DELETE /kegiatan/{id}
Ctrl --> Page : response / redirect
Ctrl -> ModelKegiatan : delete()
ModelKegiatan --> Ctrl : Hasil proses
Ctrl --> Page         : Redirect dengan notifikasi sukses
Page --> User         : Tampil notifikasi sukses

@enduml